<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Oroome Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Oroome Asaas Aadhdhida Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oroome Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oro</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Oroome Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaare Phawuloosa kiitay Oroome asaas xaafettiday Phawuloosi Oroomen diza Woosa Keeththayo gakki beyanaas qoppida gishshas istti iza giigetti naagana mala erisanaassa. Phawuloosas diza qofay Oroomen diza ammaniza asaara guuththa wode ooththidaappe guye istti iza maaddiko izi Ispeene biitta baanaassa; izi baas gelida mala isttaskka ammanoy geliin ammanizayti ba duussan ammano bessana mala ammano timirte hano isttas ubbaa birshi xaafides; Phawuloosa kiitay kumeth gidi beettiday hayssa ha kiitazanna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Oroomen diza ammaniza asaas ba saroka yeddidaappenne isttas izi woossana qaala gelidaappe guye ba kiitaas waanna ayfe yo7o (1:17) «Xoossafe beettiza xilloteth ammanonne ammanos gidida mala Mishiraachcho qaalan qonccides» giza qaala gididayssa bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hessafe guye Phawuloosi hayssa ha qofaza gujji aassi xaafees; Ayhudatakka gidiin woykko hankko dere asaa gidiin asi wurikka nagaras haarettida gishshas Xoossara maqaynnanaas bessees; asay Xoossara maqaynnana dandayzay Yesus Kirstoosan ammanonna. Hessi asay Xoossara doommida ooraththa issifeteththa ayfey ooraththa de7o gididayssa Phawuloosi lo7eththi erisees; ammanizaadey Xoossara saron de7ees; Xoossa Ayana baggara hessaadey nagarappenne hayqo wolqqafe wozzettees; shempo 5-8 gakkanaas Phawuloosi Xoossa wogaa gishshassinne ammanizayta de7on ooththiza Xoossa Xillo Ayanas qofay aazakko qonccisees. Qasseka gujjidi Phawuloosi, «Asa zereththa gishshas Xoossas diza qofa giddon Ayhudaynne Ayzaabey issife oykettanaas dandayzee?» giza oyshos zaaro immanaas baaxetees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Qasseka Phawuloosi qonccisida mala Ayhudati Yesusa ammanontta attiday Xoossa qofaa mala; hessika haniday Yesus Kirstoosa baggara Xoossi qonccisida iza atoteththa kiyan kumeth asa zereththi wurikka gakki ekkana gaththanaassa; gido attiin Ayhuda asay Yesusan ammanana wodey yaanayssa Phawuloosi ammanees. Wurseththan Phawuloosi ammanon waani de7anaakkonne harappeka ammanizayti ba garsan baas diza gaytoteththan siiqo oge kaallanaas bessizayssa istta erisees. Gujjidikka isttas Xoossa ooso gishshas ammanizayti ba dere gishshas, ba garsan issoy issaa naaganaas bessiza alaafeteththa gishshassinne qofappe dendiza oyshata ubbaa hu7en hu7en erisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Ha maxaafazi oykkida ayfe qofata <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asa naas atoteththi koshshees <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18—3:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi asa naa ashshiza oge <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21—4:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosa baggara beettiza ooraththa de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1—8:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele asay Xoossa qofa garsan <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1—11:36</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniza asa lo7o ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1—15:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurseththa saroka <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14—16:27</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Yesus Kirstoosa ayllenne Hawaare gidanaas xeygettida Mishiraachcho qaalaa yootanaas Phawuloosappe kiitettida kiita.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>He mishiraachcho qaalaa gishshas kase nabeta baggara Geeshsha Maxaafatan ufayssi imettides. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Mishiraachcho qaalaykka ba naaza gishshas izi asho baggara Dawite zereththafe gididayssa yootiza gishshassa. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Hessaththoka nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi ba geeshshateththa Ayanan hayqoppe dendidayssi izi Xoossa naa gididayssi gita wolqqan qonccides. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Kirstoosa sunththaa gishshas ammanontta derey ammanana malanne azazettana mala iza baggara nuni hawaarateththas gaththiza kiyateth ekkidos. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Intteka Yesus Kirstoosayta gidana mala xeygettidaytara deeta.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Xoossan dosettidaytanne geeshshata gidanaas xeygettida Oroome biittan diza inttes ubbaas nu Aawaa Xoossaafenne nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Oroome Beyana Laamoteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Intte ammanoy kumeththa alamen siyettida gishshassinne intte gishshas ta Godaa Xoossa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara galatays. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Ta intte gishshas ubba wode ay mala qoppizaakkonne Xoossa naa mishiraachcho sabbakon ta kumeththa wozinappe izas ooththiza Xoossay taas markka. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Tani ta woosan ubba wode inttena qoppays; ha7i qasse wurseththan Xoossa shene gidikko ta intteko baana mala Xoossi taas oge doyana mala woossays. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Intte minnana mala maaddiza Ayana imota ta intte gishshassinne inttena ayfera beyanaas laamotays. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Hessika intteninne tani issoy issaara ammanon minettanaassa.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ta ishatoo! Harason ammanonttayta matan taas hanida mala intte matankka taas ooso ayfey beettana mala daro wode qoppadis shin hanno gakkanaas ta digettada dizayssa intte erana mala koyays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Hawa 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Tamaardaytas gidiin tamaaronttaytaska, eratassinne eeyatas ubbaas ta bolla tamaarsana acoy dees. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Inttes Oroomen dizaytaska tani mishiraachcho qaala yootanaas ta amottizay hessassa.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Ammanizayti wuri attana mala Xoossa wolqqa gidida gishshas tani mishiraachcho qaalan yeellatikke; hessika koyro Ayhudatas kaallidi Ayzaabetassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar 8:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>«Xilloy Xoossa ammanon dees» geetettidi kase xaafettida mala Xoossa xilloteththi mishiraachcho qaalan qoncciina; he xilloteththay koyroppe wurseth gakkanaas ammanon hanana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Im 2:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Nayta Iitateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Tumaa ba iitateththaninne makkallan tucci oykkizayta iitateththaa bollanne istta makkallateththaa ubbaa bolla Xoossa hanqoy saloppe qonccana. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Istti eranaas bessizaaz Xoossi ubbaa isttas qonccisida gishshas istti Xoos eranaas qoncce gidides. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Alamey medhettoosofe haa simmiin asa ayfen beetti erontta Xoossa hanoteththi hessika izas diza mernaa wolqqaynne Xoossateththay izi medhdhida medheteththaan qonccen beettees; hessa gishshas asay shiishshana gaasoykka deenna. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Istti Xoos erikkoka iza Xoossateththaa mala iza bonchchibeettenanne galatibeettenna; gido attiin istta qofay mela go7ay bayndaaz gididessinne yuushshi qoppontta mala istta wozinay dhumides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Efe 4:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Istti bana, «Era» gizayta gidikkoka eeyata gidida. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Mernaa Xoossa bonchcho hayqqiza asaninne kafotan; mehetaninne biitta bolla gooshettiza medheteththatan misatissidi laammida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Zaare 4:16-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi istta ba giddon issoy issaara barkka ba asateththaan tuna ooso ooththana mala geeshshateththi baynda laymateththas aaththi immides. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Istti Xoossa tumateth wordon laammida; medhdhida Xoossaa aggidi medheteththas goynnidanne isttas ooththida; medhdhida Xoossi izi mernaas galatettidayssa. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Hessa gaason Xoossi istta yeellachchiza amoteththas aaththi immides; istta maccassati kase losettida gaytoteththa wogaa losey baynda wogan laammida. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Hessaththoka attuma asay baas bessiza maccassatara zin7anayssa aggidi addey addera zin7anaas amon xuugettidi maccassatara zin7iza mala addey addera zin7idi pala miish ooththida; heytantti barkka ba ooththida iita oosozas bessiza qixaate ba bolla ehida.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Qasseka istti ba qofara Xoos eroy nuna maaddenna gida gishshas istti ooththanaas bessonttayssa ooththana mala Xoossi istta go7ontta qofas aaththi immides. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Ubba baggara makkallanne iitateth, yiiqenne iita ooson xalala kumida; qanaateteththan, shemppo wodhon, ooshshan, baleththoninne genen kumidayta qasseka zigirzayta gidida. <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>Asa sunth moorizayta, Xoos ixxizayta, as cayizayta, otoranchchatanne ceeqettizayta gidida, ubba wode iita ooththanaas oge koyzayta, bana yelidaytas azazettonttayta, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>yuushshi qopponttayta, gida qaala zaari laallizayta, asas mishettonttayta; menxe iitata. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>«Hessa ooththizayti wurikka hayqqanaas bessees» giza Xoossa wogaa istti erishe heytantta baas ooso xalala gidontta hessaththo ooththizaytakka minththeththeettes.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Hessa gishshas nenoo hara bolla pirdizaysso neni ta hanni gaason ooththadis giza gaasoykka nees deenna; ne hara asa bolla pirdizayssan nerkka nees kunane ekkaasa; gaasoykka hara asa bolla ne pirdizayssa nekka zaarada iza ooththiza gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mato 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luqa 6:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Hayta malaata ooththiza asata bolla Xoossa pirday likke gididayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Hessa gishshas ne asa bolla pirdashe he ne pirdizayssa zaara ooththizaade gidikko ne Xoossa pirdafe kessa ekka attana nees misatizee? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Woykko Xoossa kiyateththi nena maaroteththaako kaaleththizayssa shaakka erontta dashe iza gita kiyateththaanne iza dandaya dureteththaa ne leqqay?<verse eid="ROM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Gido attiin neni ne wozina muumeteththaninne maaroteth koyontta ne wozina gaason Xoossaa tuma pirday qoncciza wode Xoossa hanqo gallassas ne bolla daro hanqo shiishshaasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Xoossi issaas issaas iza ooso mala immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maza 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Leemi 24:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Lo7o ooso aggontta ooththidi bonchcho sabanne mernaa de7o koyzaytas mernaa de7o immana. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Gido attiin barkka bana dosizaytassinne tumaa aggaagidi iita kaallizayta bolla pirdaynne hanqoy gakkana. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Iita ooththiza ay asa bollaka koyro Ayhuda asa bolla, kaallidi Ayzaabeta bolla waayeynne metoy gakkana. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Gidikkoka lo7o ooththizaades oonaska Ayhuda asas gidiin Ayzaabetas sabay, saroteththinne bonchchoy gidana. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Xoossi oonakka shaakki maaddenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Kase wogay eqqontta wode nagara ooththida asay wurikka wogay baynda dhayana; wogay eqqi simmiin nagara ooththidayti wogan oykettidi pirdettana. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Ays giikko Xoossa achchan xillo geetettizayti eqqida wogaas azazettizaytappe attiin wogaa sis siyizayta xalla gidettenna. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Wogay baynda Ayzaabeti wogay yootizayssa coo mela hanoteththafe eridi ooththishin isttas wogay baynda aggikokka isttas medheteththa wogay diza gishshas istti ba ooththanayssa ereettes. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Istta wozinay isttas markkattiza gishshassinne istta qofay istta mootiza gishshas qasseka istta maaddiza gishshas wogay yootizay istta wozinan xaafettidayssa ereettes. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Hessika ta Mishiraachcho qaalan tamaarsiza mala Xoossi asa wozinan qotettidayssa Kirstoosa baggara pirdiza gallassan qonccisana.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudatanne Istta Wogaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Ne nena Ayhuda as giikko wogan ammanettaasanne nees Xoossara diza issifeteththaan ceeqettaasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Wogaa kaalliza gishshas Xoossa shene erada kumeth gidizaaz shaakka eridaa gidikko, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>ne qooqeta kaaleththizaade; dhuman dizaytas poo7o gididayssa ne ammanettidaade gidikko <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>wogaappe ne demmida erateththaninne tumateththan hankko eronttayta zorizaade, guuththa nayta tamaarsizaade gidikko, <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>neni harata tamaarso aggada ne hu7es aazas tamaarkkii? Neni hara as kaysotoppa ga sabbakashe nees kaysotay? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Neni hara asi laymatontta mala yootashe nees laymatay? Nees eeqa ixxaasa shin Xoossa Keeththa miishshaa bonqqay? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Neni wogaan ceeqettaasa shin wogaa ne baggara ooththontta aggada Xoossa kawushshay? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Hessika, «Intte gaason Xoossa sunththi Ayzaabeta achchan cayettees» geetetti xaafettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa 52:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Ne wogaa naaga polizaade gidikko qaxxaras go7ay dees; ne wogaa ooththonttaade gidikko qasse ne qaxxaray coo hada. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Qaxxarettontta dishe wogay gizayssa polikko qaxxarettidaadera gina qoodettennee? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Nees xaafettida wogaynne qaxxaray nees diikko diza wogaa ne naagonttaade gidikko hankko qaxxarettontta dishe wogaas azazettiday ne bolla pirdana.<verse eid="ROM 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Issaadey coo mela sunththas asa ayfen ta Ayhuda as gidana giikko izi Ayhuda as gidenna; tumappe qaxxereteththi coo karera asho ayfen beettiza qaxxara gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Gidikkoka issi asi Ayhuda as gidanaas dandayzay izas gaaththa baggay Ayhuda as gidishinna. Qaxxaraykka qaxxara gidizay xaafettida woga xalala gidontta Ayanan wozinappe gidida qaxxara gidikkoko! Hessa mala asi galata asappe gidontta Xoossafe demmees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Zaare 30:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Histtiko Ayhuda as gideththas aaza go7ay dizee? Qaxxaray ay go7izee? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Awarakka gidiin go7ay daro; harappe koyro Xoossa qaalay hadara Ayhudatas imettides. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Isttafe issotas issotas ammanoy baynda aggiko Xoossan ammaneteth diggizee? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Mulekka diggenna! Asi wurikka wordanchcha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Neni ne qaalaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">dendidayssan tumanchcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">ne morkke pirdankka xoonaasa»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">geetetti xaafettida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Xoossi qasse tumanchcha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Maza 51:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Nu makkalla oosoy Xoossa xilloteth qonccen bessizayssa gidikko histtiin nu ay gaanee? Coo asa woga mala palamettanaas Xoossi ba hanqo nu bolla ehizayssi nuus bessenna gaaneyee? Hessaka ta gizay asaththo qofanna. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Tumappe hessaththo hanenna; hessaththo hanizaa gidikko Xoossi alame bolla wostti pirdandee?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>«Ta wordoteththi Xoossa tumateth qonccisizayssan iza bonchcho gede gujjizaa gidikko histtiin ha7i gakkanaas wostti ta bolla nagaranchcha mala pirdettizee?» giidi palamettana asi daana dandayees. <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Hessa guussi, «Lo7oy yaana mala ane iita ooththoos» geettes giidi issi issi asati nu bolla woresizayssa mala. Hayta asata bolla gakkiza pirday tumu pirda.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi Wuri Nagaranchcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Histtiin nu ay giinoo? Nuni isttafe aadhdhizonii? Mulekka aadhdhoko. Ayhudata gidikkoka, Ayzaabeta gidikkoka wurikka nagarappe garsa baggara diza gishshas ta wursaka kasetada isttas yootadis.<verse eid="ROM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>«Xilloy oonikka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:10">issaadeyka deenna.<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Yuushshi qoppizaadey baa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Xoos koyzay issaadeyka baa.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Wurikka balettidanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">issi bolla go7onttayta gidida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Lo7o ooththizay oonikka baa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">issaadeyka deenna.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Istta doonay doya diza duufo mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">istta doonay ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">baleththo haasayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">istta metershay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">shooshsha marzera dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Maza 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:3">140:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Istta doonan qanggeththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:14">camo miishshi kumides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Maza 10:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Istta tohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:15">suuth gussanaas eesotees.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Istta ogen dhayoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:16">laafateththi dees.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Istti saroteththa oge erettenna.<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Istta ayfeson Xoossas yashshateththi baa»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:18">geetetti xaafettida mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Maza 36:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Hessa gishshas doonay wurikka gordettana mala derey kumeth Xoossas zaaro immana mala wogay gizay wurikka wogappe giddora dizaytas gididayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Hessa gishshas wogay nagaray aazakko erisees attiin wogaa naagon oonikka iza achchan xillo geetettanaas dandayenna.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanon Beettiza Xilloteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Ha7i qasse kase nabeti izas markkattidayssi wogaappe karera gidida Xoossa xilloteththi qonccides. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Hessi Xoossa xilloteththi Yesus Kirstoosa ammanon dummateththi baynda beettiza xilloteththa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gala 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Gaasoykka asi wurikka nagara ooththides; Xoossa bonchchoyka asa naas paccides. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Asay Yesus Kirstoosi asa naa gishshas ooththida kiyateththafe dendidayssan coo mela xillides. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Iza suuththan gidida ammanon nagarappe maarettana yarsho histtidi Xoossi Yesusa shiishshides; izi hessa ooththiday kasetidi polettida nagara qaxxayontta dandayan aadhdhida ba xilloteth bessanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Izi hessa ha wodezan ooththiday ba xilloteththaa; hessika ba baggara xillo gidida Yesus Kirstoosan ammanizaade xillisizayssa bessanaassa.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Histtiin nuni izan ceeqettiza miishshi aazi dizee? Aykko miishshankka ceeqettoko; nu ceeqettana gaasoykka aazee? Wogaa naagiza gishee? Gidenna; ammanonna. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Ay asikka ammanon attiin wogaa naagon attonttayssa nu geeshshi yootoos.<verse eid="ROM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Xoossi Ayhudatas xallaa? Ayzaabetaska Xoos gidennee? Ee Ayzaabetaska izi Xoossa. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Qaxxarettidayssa ammanon qasse qaxxarettonttayssaka he ammanonkka xillisizaykka izi issi Xoossaa xalla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Zaare 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gala 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Histtiin hessi hessa gidikko ammano gaason wogaa go7ay baynda miish ooththinoo? Mulekka hessaththo hanenna; Wogaa nu minththana attiin.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammanon Abrahaame Xilleteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Hessa gishshas qasse nu Abrahaamey hayssafe ay go7a demmides giinoo? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Abrahaamey ba ooson xillidaakko izi ceeqettanaazi izas deesikoshin; izi Xoossa sinththan ceeqettanaas dandayenna. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, «Abrahaamey Xoos ammanidessinne iza ammanoy izas xilloteththan qoodettides» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medhe 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gala 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Issaadey ooso ooththiko izi ekkiza miishshay izas coo kiyateth imettizaaz gidontta izaades ooso waaga gidees. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Gido attiin ooso ooththontta nagaranchcha asi xillo kessiza Xoossan ammanizaades iza ammanoy izas xilloteththan taybettees. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Dawitikka xilloteththi izaades qoodettizay lo7o ooson gidontta asa gishshas,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>«Isttas istta bala oosoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">atto geetettidaytinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">nagarappe maarettidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">anjjettidayta!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Iza nagaraa Goday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">mulekka qoodonttaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">izi anjjettidayssa!» gides.<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Ha anjjozi qaxxarettidaytas xalalayee? Woykko qaxxarettonttaytassaraa? «Kase koyro nu aawaa Abrahaame ammanoy izas xilloteththan qoodettides» gidos.<verse eid="ROM 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Histtiin waani izas hessaththo qoodettidee? Izi qaxxarettidaappe guyee? Woykko qaxxarettanaappe kasee? Izas xilloteththan qoodettiday izi qaxxarettanaappe sinththana. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Izi kase qaxxarettanaappe kase demmida xilloteththay qaxxaras malata gidana mala xilloteththas maatame ekkides. Hessa gishshas qaxxarettontta ammanizaytas xilloteththan qoodettana mala ubbatas izi aawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medhe 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Izi qaxxarettidaytaska aawa; qaxxarettidaytas xalala gidontta nu aawaa Abrahaamey kase qaxxarettanaappe sinththe izas diza ammano geedo kaallizaytas ubbaassa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza Asas Imettida Ufays</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Izi alame laattizaade gidana mala Abrahaameynne iza zereththati ufayssa qaala ekkiday woga baggara gidontta ammanon gidida xilloteththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Medhe 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gala 3:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Woga naagizayti laattizayta gidikko ammanos go7ay deenna; hidotaykka coo hada gidanashin; <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>wogay hanqo kaaleththees; wogay bayndason woga menththoy deenna.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Hessa gishshas hidotay ammanon yides; hessika iza hidotay iza kiyateththan gidana malanne Abrahaame zereth ubbaas ammanettizayssa gidana mala hanides; hessika wogan izayta gididaytas xalala gidontta ammanon Abrahaame nayta gididaytas ubbatassa; izikka nuus ubbaasikka aawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gala 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Hessika, «Ta nena daro dere aawa ooththadis» geetetti xaafettida mala hanides; izikka hayqqidaytas de7o immizaaden, bayndayssa qasse diza mala ooththizaaden ammanida Xoossa sinththan izi nuus aawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Medhe 17:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Kase izas, «Ne zereththi hessaththo hanana» geetettida mala hidota ooththanaas dandayettontta miishshan Abrahaamey Xoossi hanana gidayssa ammanidi daro dere aawa gidides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medhe 15:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Abrahaames yelettiin 100 layth gidishin Abrahaamey ba asateththay hayqeththa mala gididayssanne Saaras yelo wodey aadhdhi bidayssa erishekka ammanon leppibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Medhe 17:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Gede gujjidi ammanon minnidi Xoossas bonchcho immides attiin Xoossi gida qaalaa sidhibeenna. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Xoossi izas immida hidotay polettanayssa kumeththa wozinappe ammanides. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Hessa gishshas izas xilloteththan qoodettides. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>«Izas xilloteththan qoodettides» giza qaalay xaafettiday izas xalala gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Gido attiin Xoossi nu xilloteththaa iza baggara taybiza nu Godaa Yesusa hayqoppe denththidayssan ammaniza nuussarakko. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Izi nu nagara gishshas hayqqanaas aadhdhi imettides; izi nuna xillisanaas hayqoppe dendides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa 53:4-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Saroteththinne Ufays</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Histtiko nuni ammanon xillida gishshas nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nuus Xoossara saroteththi dees. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Hayssa ha ammanozan minni diza kiyateththan nuni geliday iza baggara gidida gishshas ufayssan Xoossa bonchcho gishetti ekkizayta gidida gishshas nu ufayettoos.<verse eid="ROM 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Hayssan xalala gidontta nuna gakkiza waayenkka ufayettoos. Gaasoykka waayey dandayan gaththizayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>Dandayay paacen minoteth immees; paacen minoteththi hidota immees. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>He hidotay qasse nuna yeellachchenna. Xoossi nuus immida Xillo Ayanan ba siiqo nu wozinan gussida gishshas he hidotay nuna yeellan gaththenna.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Nu daaburanchchata gidi dishin Xoossa wodey gakkida mala Kirstoosi nu nagara gishshas hayqqides. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Xillo asa gishshas hayqqana asi beettanayssi daro metees. Lo7o asa gishshas hayqqanaas xalana asi oonee erizay beettana dandayees. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Gido attiin nu buro nagaranchcha gidi dishin Kirstoosi nu gishshas hayqqides; hessika Xoossi nuna siiqiza ba siiqo hessan bessees.<verse eid="ROM 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Nuni iza suuththan geeyidayta gidikko harappeka iza baggara Xoossa hanqofe attana. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Nu Xoossas morkketa gidi dishin iza naaza hayqon izara giigidayta gidikko nu izara giigidaappe guye iza naaza de7o baggara nuni paxidayssi waani keehi darennee! <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Hessa xalala gidenna; qasseka nuni ha7i izara giiga demmida nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara Xoossankka ufays ooththoos.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hayqoy Addaame Baggara, De7oy Kirstoosa Baggara Yides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Hessa gishshas nagaray issaade gaason duge ha alameza yida mala hayqoykka nagara gaason yides; hayqoykka hessa baggara asa ubbaakko yides; hessas gaasoykka asi wurikka iza baggara nagara ooththida gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Medhe 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Wogay imettanaappe kase nagaray biitta bolla dees shin wogay bayndason nagaray nagara gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Gido attiin Addaameppe haa simmiin Muse wode gakkanaas diza woden Addaame mala woga menththidi nagara ooththonttayta bollaka hayqoy kawotides; Addaamey buro yaana Kirstoosas leemiso.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Gidikkoka iza kiyateththa imotay asa qoho mala gidenna; issaadey mooridayssan daro asay hayqqikokka Xoossa kiyateththaninne issi as Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththan yida imotay darotas keehi dari imettides. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16-17"/>Qasseka Xoossa imotay issaade baggara yida nagarappe beettida ayfe mala gidenna; gaasoykka iza pirday issaade nagara kaallidi pirda ekki yides; iza imotay qasse daro qoho gaason xilloteth ehides. Hayqoy issaade baggara kawotidayssa gidikko daro tirpa gidida Xoossa kiyateththinne xilloteththa imota ekkidayti issaade baggara hessika Yesus Kirstoosa baggara xoonidi de7on daana.<verse eid="ROM 5:16-17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Histtiko issaade qoho gaason pirday asa ubbaa bolla gakkida mala hessaththoka issaade xilloteththa ooson as ubbaas de7o immiza xilloteththi beettides. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Issaadey azazettontta ixxida gishshas daro asay nagaranchcha gidida mala issaade azazeteththan qasse daroti xillana.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Wogay yiin mooroy darides; gido attiin nagaray daroyssafe bollara Xoossa kiyateththi keehi darides. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Hessika haniday nagaray hayqo bolla kawotidayssa mala Yesus Kirstoosa baggara qasse mernaa de7oy beettana mala iza kiyateththi xilloteththan kawotanaassa.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagarappe Shaakettidi Kirstoosan Duus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Histtiin nu ay giinoo? Xoossa kiyateththi darana mala nagara gujji ooththinoo? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Mulekka gidenna; nuni nagaras hayqqidos; histtiin hayssafe guye nu waani nagaran daanee? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Nuni Yesus Kirstoosara issino gidana mala xammaqettidayti iza hayqon nu issife gidanaas xammaqettidayssa hayssa intte erekketii? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Hessa gishshas Kirstoosi ba Aawaa bonchchon hayqoppe dendida mala nunikka hessaththo ooraththa de7on daanaas xinqatan hayqqidi izara moogettidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Qola 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Nuni hessa mala hayqon izara issino gidikko qasse denththankka izara issino gidoos. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Hayssafe guye nuni nagaras aylle gidontta mala nagara asateththay kichchana mala kase nu ceega asateththay izara issife kaqettidayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Gaasoykka hayqqida asi nagarappe shempides.<verse eid="ROM 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Nuni Kirstoosara hayqqidayta gidikko nu izara issife daanayssa ammanoos. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Kirstoosi hayqoppe dendida gishshas nam7anththo izi hayqqonttayssanne iza bolla hayqos wolqqay bayndayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Izi hayqqida wode issito ubbaa nagara gishshas hayqqides; gido attiin Xoossas paxa duus dees. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Hessaththoka intte nagaras hayqqidi Xoossas Yesus Kirstoosa baggara paxa dizayssa erite.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Hessa gishshas iita ooththana koyza iita asho qofa koyidi hayqqida intte asateththaa bolla nagaray kawotana mala ooththofte. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Intte asateththaa iita ooso ooththiza miish ooththi nagaras haarisopite; hessa mala ooththanaappe hayqoppe gede de7on pinnida asata mala inttena Xoossas haarisite; intte asateththaa xilloteththa miishsha mala Xoossas haarisite. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Intte Xoossa kiyateththa garsan deeta attiin woga garsan dontta gishshas inttena nagaray haarenna.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xilloteththa Oosanchchata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Histtiin ay ooththinoo? Woga garsan gidontta nuni Xoossa kiyateththa garsan diza gishshas nagara ooththinoo? Mulekka ooththanaas bessenna. <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Intte inttena aylle mala shiishshiza wode intte azazettizaades aylle gididayssa ereeta; hessaththoka gede hayqokko efiza nagaras woykko xilloteththako gaththiza azazeteththas intte aylle gididayssa erekketii? <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Intte kase nagaras aylleta gidikko inttes imettida timirtezas intte wozinappe azazettida gishshas Xoossi galatetto. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Intte nagarappe wozzettidi xilloteththas aylle gidideta.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Hayssa tani asa qaalan inttes qonccen yootizay intte yeleteththan daaburanchcha gidida gishshassa. Intte kase wode intte asateththaa aylleteththasinne kaseppe aadhdhi iitana mala ooththi immida mala ha7i qasse geeshshateththaako efiza xilloteththas aylle histti haarisite.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Intte kase nagaras aylletidi diza wode intte xilloteththaafe mela attideta shin; <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>ha7i qasse intte yeellatiza miishshatappe he wode ay go7a demmidetii? Hessa he hanozas go7ay hayqo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Ha7i qasse intte nagarappe wozzettidi Xoossa aylleta gidideta; hessika inttena geeshshateththaako kaaleththees; wurseththayka mernaa de7o. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Nagara waagay hayqo; gido attiin Xoossa imotay gidikko Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara mernaa de7o.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekonne Gelo Leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ta ishatoo! Tani woga eriza asatas yootays; wogay shemppora paxa diza asaa xalala haarizayssa intte erekketii? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Issi maccassi azina gelikko ba azinara iza wogan qashettizay azinay paxa diza wode gakkanaassa; azinay hayqqiko iza machcho gidiza wogaappe anjjettawus. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Gido attiin azinay paxa dishin iza hara azina gelikko layma geetettawus; azinay hayqqiko qasse hara as gelikko kase azinaa wogaappe anjjettadus attiin, «Layma» geetettuku.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Intteka Yesus Kirstoosa asateththa baggara wogas hayqqideta; intte hayqoppe dendida Kirstoosa bagga gidiin nuni Xoossas ayfe ayfanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Nagaranchcha medheteththa shenen nu diza wode hayqos gaththiza ayfe nu ayfana mala wogay denththeththida nagara amoy nu bolla ooththides. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Ha7i gidikko kase nuna waaxi qachchida wogaas hayqqida gishshas he wogaappe wozzettidos; hessika kase ceega wogaan xaafettidayssan gidontta dishe ooraththa Ayana ogen nuni ooththanaassa.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagarara Baaxeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Histtiin nu ay giinoo? Ba hu7es wogay nagaraa? Mulekka gidenna. Woga baggara gidonttaakko nagaray aazakko nu erokko shin; wogay «Amottofa!» gonttaako amoy aazakko tumappe ta erikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Kessa 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Zaare 5:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Nagaray qasse wogappe kezida azazoy bessida ogen go7ettidi ta giddon dumma dumma iita amo denththeththides; wogay yaanaappe kase nagaray hayqqidaaza.<verse eid="ROM 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Wogay baynda kase tani paxa dayssishin wogay yiin qasse nagaray paxa gidides; ta gidikko hayqqadis. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>As ashshana qofettida azazoykka hayqo ekki yidayssa eradis. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Nagaray woga baggara beettida gaason go7ettidi tana baleththidessinne azazon wodhides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Medhe 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Hessa gishshas wogay ba baggara geeshsha; azazoykka geeshsha; xillonne lo7o. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Gido attiin lo7os hanidayssi taas hayqos gididee? Mulekka gidenna; gido attiin nagaray ba nagarateththan erettana mala lo7o gidida hano baggara ta bolla hayqo ehides; hessika nagaray azazo baggara kaseppe aaththi nagara darssides.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Wogay Ayana yo7o gididayssa nu eroos; ta qasse nagaras aylle mala bayzettida asa. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Tani ta ooththizayssa erikke; ta ooththana koyzayssa ooththa erikke shin ta ixxiza miish ooththays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gala 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Ta ooththana koyontta miish ooththizaa gidikko wogay lo7o gididayssa ta markkattays. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Hessa ooththizay tana gidontta ta gaaththan diza nagaray ooththees.<verse eid="ROM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Tanan hessika nagaranchcha gidida ta medheteththa giddon aykko lo7o miishshi bayndayssa ta erays; lo7o ooththanaas taas amoteththi dees shin pola ooththa erikke. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Ta ooththizay ooththana gaada koyza lo7o ooso gidenna; gido attiin ta ooththana koyontta iita ooso ooththays. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Tani ooththanaas koyonttayssa ooththizaa gidikko hessa ooththizay tana gidontta ta giddon diza nagara.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Hessa gishshas hayssi wogay ooson dizayssi taas gelides. Hessika tani lo7o ooththana koyaysishin iita ooththays. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Tani ta gaaththara Xoossa wogaan ufayettays. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Gido attiin ta asateththa giddon ooththiza nagara wogay tana qachchi oykkidi ta qofa wogaara olettiza hara wogay ta asateththa giddon ooththishin beyays. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Ta ay mala laafa asee! Hayssa hayqos imettida asateththafe tana ashshanay oonee? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara galatay Xoossas gido.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Histtiko tani ta baggara ta qofan Xoossa wogaas aylle gidashe tani ta medheteththa wogan nagara wogas aylle.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Xillo Ayanan Duussa Gishshassinne Ashon Duussa Gishshas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Hessa gishshas Yesus Kirstoosa ammanizayta bolla pirday deenna. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Gaasoykka de7o Ayana wogay Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nagarappe istta geeshshida gishshassa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Nagaranchcha ashoppe dendidayssan wogay polanaas dandayonttayssa Xoossi ba naaza nagaranchcha asa leemison nagaras yarshettana mala yeddidi polides; histtidi nagara iza ashon pirdides. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Hessika nuni ashon gidontta Ayanan simerettiza nuuppe wogay koyza xilloteththaa polanaassa.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Asho shene mala daana koyza asata wozinay ashoy koyza miishshan shempees; Ayana shene mala dizayti qasse ba wozina Ayanay koyza miishsha bolla woththeettes. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Ashos xalla qofay hayqo gidishin Ayana yo7os qofay gidikko de7onne saroteththa. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Nagaras haarettiza wozinay Xoossara ooshsha; gaasoykka izi Xoossa wogas haarettennanne haarettanaas dandayenna. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Asho shene mala diza asatikka Xoos ufayssanaas dandayettenna.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Intte qasse Xoossa Ayanay inttenan dizaa gidikko ashon gidontta Ayanan deeta; Kirstoosa Ayanay iza bolla bayndaadey Kirstoosas gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Kirstoosi intte giddon diikko qasse intte asateththay nagara gaason hayqeth gidikkoka intte Ayanay qasse xilloteththa gaason de7on dees. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Yesusa hayqoppe denththida iza Ayanay intte bolla dizaa gidikko Kirstoosa hayqoppe denththidayssi intte giddon diza iza ayanay hayqqanaas diza intte asateththas de7o immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Qoro 3:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Hessika hananay dosan gidennashin nuni asho shene mala daanaas ashos gidokko. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Asho shene mala dizaa gidikko intte hayqqana; asho ooso iitaza intte Ayanan wodhikko intte de7on daana. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Xoossa Ayanan kaallizayti istti Xoossa nayta. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Intte ekkida Ayanay zaaridi inttena aylleteththan haariza ayana gidontta «Nu Aawawu» gi xeygisiza naateteththa Ayana ekkideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gala 4:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Nuni Xoossa nayta gididayssa he Ayanay ba baggara nu ayanara issife nuus markkattees. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Nuni Xoossa nayta gidikko iza laattizayta. Nu Kirstoosa bonchchoza laattizayta gidana mala addafekka izara iza metoza gishettizayta gidikko nu Xoos laattizayta; Kirstoosarakka issife laattizayta.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buro Yaana Bonchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Ha7i nu ekkiza waayey buro nuus sinththan giigi uttida bonchchozara gaththi xeellishin aykkoka gidenna gays. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Medheteththi wurikka Xoossa nayti qonccanayssa laamoteththan naagon dees. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Medheteththi wurikka mela hada gidana mala pirdettides; hessika ba dooron gidontta sinththafes haarettana mala izi ba shene mala haarisida gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Medhe 3:17-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Hessika medheteththi wurikka dhayssa aylleteththafe wozzettidi Xoossa naytas gidida bonchchettida shene mala dizaso gakkanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Ha7i gakkanaas medheteththi wurikka daro waayen miixattishe dizayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Iza xalala gidontta koyro Xillo Ayana imota demmida nunikka nu asateththay attana; nu iza naa gidanayssaka laamotishenne wozinara miixattishe doos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2Qoro 5:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Hayssa ha hidotan xalla attidos; hidotay ayfen beettiza miish gidikko buroppe naagana koshshenna; ha7i ba ayfen be7iza miishshi buroppes naagizay oonee? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Gido attiin nuni buro nu ayfen be7ontta miish hidotan naagizaaz gidikko saletay baynda naagoos.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Hessaththoka qasse nu daaburshin Ayanay nuna maaddees; nuni woosa wostti woossanaakko erontta gishshas Ayanay nuni qaalan qonccisanaas dandayettontta qaalara nuus woossees. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Nu wozina paacci eriza Ayanay izi Ayana qofaa erees; gaasoykka Ayanay Xoossa shene mala ammaniza asaas nuus woossees.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Xoossi bana dosizaytassinne iza shene mala xeygettidaytas ubbaas ooththiza miish ubbaaka lo7os ooththizayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Xoossi kaseppe ba erizayta istti iza naaza misatana mala kasekka doori woththides; hessika daro ba ishata giddofe izi bayra gidanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Kase koyroppe ba dooridayta istta xeygides; qasseka xeygidayta xillisides; ba xillisidaytakka bonchchides.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Histtiin hessa nu ay giinoo? Xoossi nunara gidikko nunara eqettanaas dandayzay oonee? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Ba naazas mishettontta nu gishshas aaththi immiday iza; histtiin ubba miish nuus izara kiyateththan wursi aazas immennee? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Xoossi dooridayta mootizay oonee? Xillisizay Xoossa. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Histtiin pirdizay oonee? Hayqqidi hayqoppe dendidi Xoossa ushachchan uttida Yesus Kirstoosi nu gishshas gaannatees.<verse eid="ROM 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Nuna Kirstoosa siiqoppe shaakkanay oonee? Metoyee? Waayee? Woykko goodeteththee? Woykko gafaa? Woykko kalloteththee? Woykko qoppontta gakkiza metoyee? Mashshaa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Hessika kase, «Ne gishshas nu shukettiza dorsa mala qoodettidos; gallas kumeth ne gishshas nuni hayqora baaxetana» geetetti xaafettidayssa mala. <verse eid="ROM 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Nuna aazikka izappe shaakkenna; hayssa ubbaan nuna siiqidayssan xoonizaytappeka nu aadhdhoos.<verse eid="ROM 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Hessa gishshas hayqo gidiin, de7o gidiin, kiitanchchata gidiin, woykko ha7i diza miish gidiin, buro yaana miish gidiin, woykko ay wolqqama gidiin, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>dhoqqa gidiin woykko ziqqa gidiin, woykko ay medheteth gidiin Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nuus diza Xoossa siiqoppe nuna shaakkana dandayza miishshi bayndayssa ta shaakka eradis.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dooro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Ta Yesusa sunththan tumu gays; wordotikke; ta wozinaykka Xillo Ayana baggara taas markkattees. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Taas wozinappe kichchontta gita qofaynne mishay dees. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Ta dabbota gishshas ta qanggetadanne Kirstoosappe shaaketta wora wodhdhidaakko dosays. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Isttika Isra7eele nayta; istti Xoossa naa gidana mala Xoossa bonchchoynne caaqo qaalay, wogaynne Xoossa Keeththa woga hidotay isttas imettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kessa 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Kase Aawatikka istta bagga; Kirstoosi istta zereththa zarkken qoodettees; izikka ubbaafe bolla gidida mernaas galatettida Xoossaa. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Gido attiin hessa guussi Xoossa qaalay attides guus gidenna; Isra7eeleppe yelettiday wuri Isra7eele as gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Abrahaameppe yelettidayti izappe yelettida gishshas wurikka iza nayta gidettennashin, «Ne zereththi Yisaaqa baggara xeygettana» geetettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Hessa guussika Xoossa naa geetettidayti istti ashon yelidayta gidettenna; gido attiin naa gidanayti hidota qaalaan yootetti uttidayta. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>«Yiza layth hanni wode ta haa simmana; Saaraykka nees attuma naa yelana» geetettidi izas hidota qaalay imettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Medhe 18:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Hessa xalalakka gidenna; Irbiqa nayti issaade naakko! Izikka nu aawaa Yisaaqa. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Mentteti yelettidi buro iita woykko lo7o ooththontta dishin Xoossa qofay minnana mala, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>ooson gidontta xeygidayssafe gidida gishshas, «Bayray kaalozas haarettana» geetettidi Irbiqas yootettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Medhe 25:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Hessika, «Ta Yaaqoobe dosadis; Eesawe ixxadis» geetetti kase xaafettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mil 1:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Histtiin nu ha7i ay giinoo? Xoossi bessontta ogera maaddi erizee? Mulekka maaddi erenna. <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Xoossi Muses, «Ta maarana koyidaade maarana; ta mishettana koyidaadeska mishettana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kessa 33:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Hessa gishshas asi koyida mala gidontta woykko asa daaburan gidontta Xoossi maarida mala hanees.<verse eid="ROM 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay Paaroone, «Ta wolqqay ne bolla beettana malanne ta sunththi biitta ubbaa bolla yootettana mala ta nena hayssas denththadis» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kessa 9:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi maarana koyzaade maarees; iza wozina muumisana koyzaade wozina muumisees. <verse eid="ROM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Inttefe issaadey, «Histtiin hanoy hessa mala gidikko nuna hanno gakkanaas aazas waayisizee? Gaasoykka iza shene diggana dandayzay oonee?» gaada ne oychchontta aggaka.<verse eid="ROM 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Gido attiin Xoossas zaaro imos ne oonee? «Oosettida miish zaaridi ooththidayssa ne tana aazas hayssaththo ooththadii?» gi erizee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Urqqa medhdhizaadey he urqqaafe baggaa bonchchos, baggaa qasse coo hiraysso oosos medhdhanaas iza shene gidennee?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Xoossika ba hanqo bessanaassinne ba wolqqa erisanaas koyidi iza hanqo qonccisizayta, dhayanaas giigettidayta dhayssontta aggikochchi! <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Koyro bonchchos giigsida iza maaroteth bessizaytas iza bonchcho dureteththi erettana mala izi ooththanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Xeygidaadey Ayhudata baggafe xalala gidontta Ayzaabeta baggafe gidida nunakka ashshontta xeygides.<verse eid="ROM 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Hose7e maxaafan, «Ta dere gidonttayta tani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">‹Ta dereta› ga xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">tani istta dosettonttayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">‹Dosettidayta› ga xeygana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hose 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Qasseka, ‹Intte ta dere deekketa›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">geetetti yootettidason,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‹Istti de7o Xoossa nayta›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">geetetti xeygettana.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hose 1:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Isayaasikka Isra7eele nayta gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">«Isra7eele nayta qooday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">abba ace mala darikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">guuththati xalala attana.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Goday ba pirdaa biitta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">elle pirdana» gi yootides.<verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Hessika, «Wogga Goday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">nuus zereth ashshonttaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">nunikka Sodoome</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">katamaa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">Gamoora katama mala dhayanashin»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:29">geetettidi kase Isayaasa doonan yootidayssa mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Naytanne Mishiraachcho Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Histtiin nu ay giinoo? Ammanon beettida xilloteth demmanaas Ayzaabey daaburontta demmides. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Gido attiin xilloteththa woga kaalliza Isra7eele nayti demmibeettenna. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Hessi aazas hessaththo hanidee? Istti ammanon gidontta ooson demmana kaallida gishshassa; isttika dhuphe shuchchan dhuphettida. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Hessika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Hekko as dhuphiza shuch</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">istta kundisiza zaalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Xiyoone bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ta woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">izan ammanizaadey yeellatenna»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:33">geetettidi kase Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidayssa mala hanides.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ta ishatoo! Isra7eele nayta gishshas ta amoynne ta Xoos woossizay istti dhayontta attanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Istti Xoossa yo7os mishettizayta gididayssa ta istta gishshas markkattana dandayays; istta misheteththi gidikko erateththan gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Xoossi as xillisiza oge erontta aggidi ba xilloteththa oge kaallida attiin Xoossa xilloteththa oge kaallibeettenna. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Ammaniza asaa ubbaa xillisanaas Kirstoosi woga ubbaa polides.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Musey woga baggara beettiza xilloteththaa gishshas erisishe, «Hayta wogata poli ooththizaadey ha wogatan daana» gizayssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lewe 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Ammanon beettiza xilloteththi qasse, «Ne wozinara pude salo oonee kezanay? gooppa;» hessaththo guussi Kirstoosa saloppe duge haa woththana guussa. <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Woykko, « ‹Duge ciimman oonee wodhdhanay?› Gooppa!» hessika Kirstoosa hayqoppe buro denththana guussa.<verse eid="ROM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Gido attiin qaalay ay gizee? «Qaalay ne achchan dees.» Ne doonaninne ne wozinan dees, nuni ammano gishshas sabbakiza qaalay hayssa.<verse eid="ROM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Neni ne doonara, «Yesusi Godaa» gaada markkattiko Xoossi iza hayqoppe denththidayssa ne wozinan ne ammanikko attana. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Neni xillanay wozinan ammanikko; ne attanay ne doonara markkattiina. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay giza mala, «Izan ammanizay wurikka yeellatenna.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Ayhudata giddoninne Ayzaabeta giddon dummateththi deenna; issi Goday ubbaasikka Godaa; iza woossizayta gujji anjjees. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>«Godaa sunth xeygizayti wurikka attana» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Histtiin iza ammanonttayti iza wozgi xeyganee? Qasse iza gishshas siyontta dishe wostti ammananee? Sabaakey baynda dishin wostti siyanee? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kiitettontta wostti sabbakandettoo? Hessika, «Mishiraachcho qaala ekki yizayta yuussi ay mala lo7oo!» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Gido attiin siyidayti wurikka Mishiraachcho qaalaa ekkibeettenna; Isayaasi, «Godoo! Nu yootidayssa ooni ammanidee?» gida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Hessa gishshas ammanoy beettizay yootiza qaala siyeththana; yootettiza qaalaykka Kirstoosa gishshas yootiza qaalaappe.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Gido attiin asay siyibeenneeshaa? gaada ta oychchays; tumappe asay siyides; Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettida mala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«Istta qaalay biitta ubbaaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">alame gaxa gakkanaas siyettdes.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Maza 19:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Ta qasseka oychchays; Isra7eele nayti qaalaa eribeetteneeshaa? Koyro Musey isttas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Ta dere gidonttaytan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ta istta amosana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">yuushshi qoppontta deretan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ta istta yiillochchana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Zaare 32:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Isayaasikka xalateththan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Tana koyonttaytas ta beettadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">tana oychchonttaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">tana qonccisadis» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa 65:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Isra7eele gishshas qasse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Taas azazettontta derekkonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">taas eeno gontta derekko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">kumeththa gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">ta kushe miccadis» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa 65:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Isra7eele Asa Mule Yeggi Aggibeenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Histtiin Xoossi ba dereta yeggi aggidee? Gaada ta oychchays; mulekka aggibeenna; tanikka ta baggara Biniyaame zarkke, Abrahaame zereth gidida Isra7eele asa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Pili 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Xoossi koyroppe ba erida dereza yeggibeenna; Eelaasi Isra7eele nayta bolla mooto Xoossaako wostti shiishshidaakko Geeshsha Maxaafay iza gishshas ay gizaakko intte erekketii? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>«Godoo! Istti ne nabeta wodhida; nees yarshizasohotakka laallida; qasse tani tarkka attadis; tanakka wodhana geettes» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Kawo 19:10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Xoossi izas, «Ba7aale geetettiza Eeqas goynnonttayta laappun shii as tani taas ashshadis» gi zaarides<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Kawo 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Hessa malakka ha7i ha wodezankka Xoossa kiyateththan Isra7eele asaappe dooretti attida guuththati deettes. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Histtiin hessi Xoossa kiyateththan attiin asa ooson gidenna; asa ooson gididaakko Xoossa kiyateththi kiyateth gidenna.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Histtiin ay gaanee? Isra7eele nayti lo7eththi koyidayssa demmibeettenna; Xoossan doorettidayti gidikko demmida; hankko attidayta wozinay muumides. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Kase, «Istta ayfey xeellontta mala, istta hayththayka siyontta mala Xoossi hanno gakkanaas isttas doccissiza Ayana immides» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettida mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Zaare 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa 29:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Dawitikka, «Istta maadday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">istta oykkiza narxanne yarde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">isttas dhuphizaazinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">qixaate gido.<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Istta ayfey xeellofo; goozetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">istta zokkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">mernaas kuunno» gides.<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayzaabeta Ateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Ane qasse ta zaara oychchays; Isra7eele asay kundeththaafe nam7anththo dendennee? Dendana. Harappeka Isra7eele nayta qanaatissana gishshas istta mooro gaason atoteththi Ayzaabetas gakkides. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Gido attiin qasse istta mooroy Ayzaabetas anjjo gidides. Istta kundeththika qasse Ayzaabetas anjjo gidikko istti simmi attidaakko ay mala gita anjjo gidandeeshin!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Ayzaabetoo! Ta inttes yootays; ta Ayzaabetas kiitettidaade gidida gishshas ta oosoza minna polana. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Hessika ta bagga asati amosana mala denththeththada isttafe guuththa asata ashshanaas ufays ooththays. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Xoossi istta aggida Ayzaabeti Xoossara giigikko Xoossi Isra7eele nayta zaaridi ekkiza wode inttes aazi hanana misatizee? Hessa guussi, «Hayqoppe dendides» guussa mala.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Koyro bukeesoy lo7o gidikko hankko izappe oosettizayssi wurikka lo7o gidees; hessaththoka issi miththa xaphoy lo7o gidikko hankko iza bolla diza haggatikka lo7o gideettes. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Keeththa matan diza wogara miththa haggata malati intte meqqi wodhdhiin hankko woran diza wogara miththata misatiza Ayzaabeti intte kichchoosan gididi intte haaronne intte anjjo shaakki ekkizaadentta gidikko, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>heyta he meqqi wodhdhida haggata bolla otorettofa; intte istta bolla otorettiko qasse hanno wozinan woththite; he miththaa tookkiday nena gidakka; miththay nena tookkides attiin.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Histtiko, «He haggati meqqi wodhdhiday nuni istti kichchoosan gelana malassa» gontta aggeketa. <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Tumu gidetashin istti meqqiday ammano paceppe dendidayssanna. Intte qasse ammanon eqqideta; babbite attiin otorettofte. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Xoossi koyroppe diza haggatas mishettonttaade gidikko intteska mishettenna.<verse eid="ROM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossa kiyateththinne iza menxe iitateththaa ane xeella; iza menxe iitateththi kundidayta bolla; iza kiyateththi qasse intte iza qadheteththa garsan diza wode gakkanaas xalala; hessi baynda aggiko intteka qanxxettana. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Istti ammanontta minni eqqidasoppe simmiko kase ba dizaso simmi gelana; Xoossika istta zarsi gelththana dandayees. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Intte bazzo wogara miththafe qanxxetti kase intte medheteththafe gidontta lo7o miththan intte gelana dandaykko koyroppe ba medheteththa haggata gididayti heyti kase iza bolla diza wogara miththaan simmi geloy isttas waani hanennee?<figure style="fig" alt="Olive tree with its fruits" file="LB00087B.TIF" size="span" ref="11:24">Ayfera diza Wogara mith</figure><verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaas Xoossa Maaroteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ta ishatoo! Intte cincca as gididayssa inttes misatontta mala hayssa giddo xuura yo7oza intte erontta attana mala ta koykke. Hessika Ayzaabetappe xeygettidayti wuri ammanana gakkanaas Isra7eele nayta wozinay muumides. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele nayti wurikka attana. «Ashshizaadey Xiyooneppe yaana; Yaaqoobeppeka iitateth diggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Isa 59:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Tani istta nagara wursa dhayssidaappe guye ta isttara caaqon geliza qaalay hessa» geetettidi kase Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Er 31:33-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Inttes Ayzaabetas Mishiraachcho qaalay gakkana mala Isra7eele nayti Xoossan ixettida as gidida; gidikkoka kase dooroza mala gidikko ba aawata baggara istti dosettidayta. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Xoossi dooridaappenne ba kiyateth immidaappe guye ba ooththida miishshan simmidi modhettenna. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Intteka kase azazettonttaytakko! Istti azazettontta ixxiin ha7i inttena maaridayssaththo; <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Xoossi inttena maarida gaason isttika maarettana mala ha7i azazettonttayta gidida. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Xoossi wursika maaranaas asi wurikka azazettontta mala gordides.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Shiiqida Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Xoossa dureteththi, aadho erateththaynne iza erateththay ay mala ciimmaa! Iza pirday ay malakko paacettenna; izi aadhdhida geedoykka erettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa 55:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>«Godaa wozina eriday oonee? Izas zore immiday oonee? <verse eid="ROM 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Xoossi zaari immana mala izas tal7e immiday oonee?» geetetti xaafettida mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Iyo 41:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Wurikka izappe, izan, izassa; izas bonchchoy mernaappe mernaas gido! Amiin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:6">1Qoro 8:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Bessiza De7o Yarsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Intte asateththaa geeshshinne Xoos ufayssiza de7o yarsho ooththidi intte shiishshana mala ta inttena Xoossa qadhetan woossays; hessika wozinama asa mala intte Xoossas ooththiza ooso. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Lo7o, ufayssizaazinne kumeth gidida Xoossa sheney aazakko intte paacci erana mala intte qofan ooraxidi laamettite attiin hayssa alame asaa misatopite.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Inttes Xoossi immida ammano mala intterkka inttena paacci xeellite attiin ha7i dizayssafe bollara inttena dhoqqisi xeellontta mala tani taas imettida Xoossa kiyateththan inttena issaa issaa zorays. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Nuuppe issi issi asas issi asateththa bolla daro billiteti diza mala heytikka he billiteti issi mala ooso ooththonttayssaththo, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>hessaththoka nuni darota gidi uttidi Kirstoosan issi asho; nuni issoy issaas asho. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Nuus imettida imota mala dumma dumma imotay dees; issaades buroppe hananaaz yooto gidikko izaades imettida ammano mala yooto. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Ooththi maaddizaadey ooththi maaddo; tamaarsizaadeyka tamaarso. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Zorizaadey gidikko zoro; bayndaytas immizaadey gujji immo; ayssizaadey minni aysso; maarizaadeyka ufayssan maaro.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Intte siiqoteththi qoodheppe qommon gidoppo; iita gididayssa wursika ixxite. Lo7o gididayssara issife oykettite. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Intte intte garsan issoy issaara ishata mala lo7eththi siiqettite; issoy issaa baappe aaththi bonchchizayta gidite. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Godaas ooththana Ayanan xuugettizayta gidite attiin hessa he minoteththaafe guye goopite. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Hidotan ufayettizayta gidite; meto dandayte; woosan minnite. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Ammanishe waayettizaytas inttes dizayssafe shaakki immite; imath mokkite.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Inttena qanggizayta anjjite attiin qanggofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mato 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luqa 6:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Ufayettizaytara ufayettite; muuzottizaytara muuzottite. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Intte intte garsan doseteththan diite; manqotara issifeteththan daanaas koyite attiin otorettoftenne ceeqettofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Leemi 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Oonaska iita gishshas iita zaaropite; as ubbaa achchan lo7o miish ooththanaas minnite. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Inttes dandayettiko intte intte baggara as ubbaara saron diite. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Ta siiqotoo! Intte halo Xoossi kesso attiin intterkka halo kessofte. «Halo kessanay tana gees Goday» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Zaare 32:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Halo kessanaappe, «Neni ne morkkey gafikko miza; izi saamettiko ushsha; ne hessaththo ooththiko tama bonqo iza bolla koraasa» geetettidi Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Leemi 25:21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Iita lo7o ooson xoona attiin iitan xoonettofa.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Dere Ayssizaytas Azazeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Ay asikka bana ayssiza daannatas haarettanaas bessees; Xoossafe imettontta dishin daannateththi deenna; ha7i diza daannati Xoossafe daannatidayta. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Hessa gishshas daanna bolla makkalliday Xoossa wogaa bolla makkallees. He makkallizaytikka ba bolla pirda eheettes. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Dere ayssizayti iita ooththizayta babiseettes attiin lo7o ooththizayta babisettenna. Neni dere ayssizaades babbontta aggana koyay? Histtiko lo7o ooththa; izikka nena galatana. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Izi nees lo7o ooththanaas Xoossa oosanchcha; gido attiin ne iita ooththidaa gidikko izas babba; gaasoykka izi mashsha coo mela gixxibeenna; izi iita ooththizaade qaxxayanaas Xoossa oosanchcha. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Hessa gishshas iza qixaates babo xalala gidontta ne qofankka daannatizaades azazettanaas bessees.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Intte giira immizay hessassa; ayssizayta he oosoza bolla Xoossi woththides. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Isttafe issaas issaas bessizayssa immite; giira immana bessizaytas giira immite; qaraxa qanxxanaas bessizaytas qaraxa qanxxite; babbanaas bessizaytas babbite; bonchchanaas bessizayta bonchchite.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Issoy Issaara Siiqeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Intte garsan issoy issaara siiqeteththafe attiin oona bollaka acoy dooppo; as siiqiza asi izi wogaa polides. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>«Laymatoppa; wodhoppa; amottofa» gizaytinne hara azazoti diikkoka, «As ubbaaka ne mala siiqa» giza hanno issi wogayn wurikka kuuyettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14-15">Kessa 20:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">20:13</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Zaare 5:17-19</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewe 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Siiqoy asa bolla iita ooththenna; hessa gishshas siiqoy woga ubbaas kuushsha.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Hayssa wodeza caddi xeellidi hessa ooththite; ha7i hanna intte dhiskofe dendiza wode; nu kase ammanoosofe haa simmiin ha7i nuus attiza wodey matides. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Qammay aadhdhiin wonttana gees; hessa gishshas ane nu dhuma ooso wora yeggidi poo7o ola miish may7oos. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Gallassara hemettiza mala ane wogara hemettoos; magulsaninne maththon gidoppo; layma amoninne layman gidoppo; qanaateteththaninne palaman gidoppo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Hessa aggidi Yesus Kirstoosa may7ite; asho amo polanaas qoppofte.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Asa Bolla Pirdofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Intte garsan ammanon buro minnonttaade shiishshi ekkite attiin iza qofaa bolla pirdofte. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Issi issi asi beettidayssa wursi maanaas ammanoy dees; qasse ammanon minnonttaadey atakilte xalala mees. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Beettidayssa ubbaa mizaadey wursi monttaade kadhoppa; monttaadey qasse mizaade bolla pirdofo; Xoossi ubbaaka ekkides. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Hankko ooththizaade bolla pirdizaadey ne oonee? Izaadey kundiko woykko eqqikokka Godaassa; Goday iza essanaas dandayza gishshas izi eqqandes.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Issaadey, «Gallassatappe issi gallas hara gallassafe aaththidi baas dumma gallas» gi qoppees; hara asi qasse, «Gallassati wurikka issi gina» gi qoppees. Issi issi asi ba wozinan ammanida mala ooththo. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Issi gallas hara gallassafe dummasi qoppizaadey izi hessa ooththizay Godaa bonchchos gidikko mizaadeyka Godaa bonchchos giidi mees. Histtidi Xoos galatees. Monttaadeyka Godaa bonchchos giidi muus aggeessinne Xoossas galata immees. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Nuuppe oonikka baas dizaadeynne baappe baas hayqqizaadey deenna. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Nu diikkoka Godaas doos; hayqqikokka Godaas hayqqoos; hessa gishshas diikkoka woykko hayqqiko nuni Godaassa.<verse eid="ROM 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Hessa gishshas hayqqidaytassinne paxa dizaytas Godaa gidanaas Kirstoosi hayqqidi hayqoppe paxi dendides. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Histtiin ne aazas ne ishaa bolla pirday? Aazas ne ishaa leqqay? Nu wurikka Xoossa pirda wombora sinth shiiqana doos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Qoro 5:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>«Ta paxa days;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">gulbatey wurikka taas gulbatana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Inxarsi wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Xoossas markkattana»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 14:11">geetetti kase Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Hessa gishshas nuni issi issi asi Xoossa sinth shiiqidi nu ooso gishshas izas zaaro immana.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Hessa gishshas nuni nu garsan issoy issaa bolla pirdanaappe ane naagettoos; hessa aggidi nu ishaas dhuphe gidizayssa woykko iza oykkiza narxa woththontta mala ane nu naagettoos. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Tani Godaa Yesusan ammanada miza kaththan tunay bayndayssa eradis; gido attiin issaadey issi miish tuna gi qoppiko he miishshay izaades tuna. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Neni ne ishaas miza kaththa gaason dhuphe gidikko siiqon simerettabeekka; Kirstoosi iza gishshas hayqqida ne ishaa ne miza kaththa gaason wodhoppa. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Intte lo7o giidi qoppiza miishshi iita geetettana mala ooththofte. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Xoossa kawoteththi Xillo Ayanan beettida xilloteth, saroteththinne ufayssafe attiin muussa yo7onne ushsha yo7o gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Hayssaththo Kirstoosas ooththizaadey Xoos ufaysseessinne asa achchanka galatettees.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Hessa gishshas saroteththi beettiza ogenne nuni nu garsan lo7anaas bessiza oge ane koyoos. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Nuni miza kaththa gaason Xoossa ooso ane moorokko; kaththi wurikka geeshsha; gido attiin hara asas dhuphe gidiza kath muussi bala ooso. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Ne ishaas dhuphe gidizaaz gidikko ashokka maanaappenne woyne cajje uyanaappe woykko ay miishshika ne ooththontta aggiko lo7o.<verse eid="ROM 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Hessa gishshas haytantta misatiza miishshatas nees diza ammanoy ne giddoninne Xoossa giddon de7o. «Hayssi likkeko» giidi ammanon ekkida miishshan barkka ba bolla pirdonttaadey izaadey anjjettidaade. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Gido attiin wozinara sidhishe miikko izi ammanon montta gishshas iza bolla pirdettides; ammanon ooththonttaazi wurikka nagara.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Nuni ammanon minnidayti hankko ammanon minnonttayta meto tookkanaas bessees attiin nu xalla ufayettizayta gidanaas bessenna. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Nuni wurikka hara asi ba ammanon minnana mala iza go7izaazinne ufayssiza miish ane ooththoos. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kirstoosi bana ufayssibeenna; harappeka, «Asay nena cayida cashshay tana gakkides» geetetti kase Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidayssi polettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maza 69:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Nuni Geeshsha Maxaafatappe demmiza dandayaynne minoteththi nuus daana mala koyroppe xaafettidayssi wurikka nu izappe nuus timirte demmana mala xaafettides.<verse eid="ROM 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Minoteththinne dandaya immiza Xoossi intte Yesus Kirstoosa kaallishin inttes intte giddon Ayana issifeteth immo. <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>Hessika intte issi wozinaninne issi doona gididi nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Aawaa Xoossa bonchchanaassa.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanontta Deretas Sabbakettida Mishiraachcho Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi inttena Xoossa bonchchon mokki ekkida mala intteka issoy issaa ufayssan mokki ekkite. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Kase aawatas imettida hidota qaalaa polanaas Xoossa tumateththi erettana mala Kirstoosi Ayhudatas ooththizaade gididayssa ta inttes yootays. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Hessaththoka Ayzaabeti iza maaroteththaa gishshas Xoos galatana mala; hessika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Ta nena dere giddon galatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">ne sunththaaska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">galata mazamure yexxana»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:9">geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettida mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Same 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Maza 18:49</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Qasseka, «Ayzaabetoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Intteka Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">deretara ufayettite»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:10">geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Zaare 32:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Nam7anththoka, «Ayzaabeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">intte wurikka Godaa galatite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">derey wuri iza sabbite»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:11">geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Maza 117:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Hessaththo Isayaasan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Ba dere asaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">kawotiza Isseye nay yaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Alame asaa ayssizaadey dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">isttika izan ufayettana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Intte izan ammaniza gishshas hidota Xoossi inttenan ufayssinne saroteth kunththo; hessika Xillo Ayana wolqqa hidotay inttes daranaassa.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayzaabeta Oosanchcha Phawuloosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ta ishatoo! Intte lo7eteththan, erateth ubbaan kumidaytanne harata zoranaas eray dizayta gididayssa ta addafe shaakka eradis. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Ta Xoossafe ekkida imotaa gina qasseka inttena qofsanaas issi issi yo7ota xalateththan inttes xaafadis. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Hessa he kiyateththi imettiday tani Xoossa Mishiraachcho qaalaa hankko deretas yootana malassa; qasseka qeese mala gidida Yesus Kirstoosas ooththanaassa; hessa gishshas hankko dere asay Xillo Ayanan dummatidi Xoos ufayssiza yarsho gididi shiiqana mala ooththays.<verse eid="ROM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Hessa tani Xoossas ooththiza gishshas Yesus Kirstoosan ceeqettays. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ta yootidayssaninne ta ooththidayssan hankko dere asay Xoossas azazettana mala Kirstoosi tanan gididi ooththidaazappe attiin hara haasayana xalikke. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Hessika haniday Xillo Ayana wolqqan malaatata baggara hanides; hessa malankka Yerusalaameppe Ilwaqoore gakkanaas ta Kirstoosa Mishiraachcho qaalaa sabbakadis.<verse eid="ROM 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Hara asi kase ooththidason ta gelontta mala gaada kase Kirstoosa sunththi xeygetti eronttason Mishiraachcho qaalaa sabbakanayssi taas amo. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Harappeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">«Iza gishshas isttas yootetonttayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">iza beyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">siyi eronttayti akeekana»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:21">geetetti kase Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa 52:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Hessa gaason ta intteko bontta mala daro wode digettadis.<verse eid="ROM 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oroome Beyanaas Phawuloosa Giigeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Ha7i qasse taas haan oosoy baynda gishshas daro layththatappe haa simmiin inttena beyanaas ta daro laamotadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Oro 1:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>Hayssa ta qofaa tani Ispeene biza wode polanaas qoppays; heera aadhdhashe inttena beyanaassinne inttenara guuththa wode gam7ada laamota aaththida mala intte tana maaddana gaada hidota ooththays.<verse eid="ROM 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Ha7i qasse ammanizaytas imettiza maado miish ekkada Yerusalaame bays. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Gaasoykka Maqidooniyaninne Akayan diza manqota maaddana Xoossa derey dendides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1Qoro 16:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Hayssa ha maadoza istti ba dosan immiday istti ooththanaas bessiza gishshassa; Ayzaabeti Ayhudatara issife Ayana anjjo ekkizayta gidikko isttika baas diza biittaa anjjon Ayhudata maaddanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1Qoro 9:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Hessa gishshas hayssa shiiqida maado miishshaa Yerusalaamen immidaappe guye intte achchara ta Ispeene baana. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Ta hee intteko bashe inttes Kirstoosa anjjo kunththa ekka baanayssa ta erays.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ta ishatoo! Tani Xoossa woosan baaxetiza mala intteka tanara baaxetana mala ta inttena Godaa Yesus Kirstoosaninne Xillo Ayana siiqon woossays. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Tani Yuhudan diza ammanontta asaa kusheppe attana malanne Yerusalaamen diza ta oosoykka heen ammanizayta achchan ekettana mala taas woossite. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Hessika Xoossa shene mala hee intteko ta ufayssara baana malanne inttenara issife shempanaassa. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Saroteththa Goday inttenara ubbatara gido. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kinkira7oose Woosa Keeththan ooththiza ammanettida michcheyo Pebeeno inttes hadara gays. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Ammaniza asas bessiza moko intte izo Godaa sunththan mokki ekkana malanne iza inttefe koyza ay miishshankka intte izo maaddana mala ta inttena qofsays.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Kase tanara Godaa Yesus Kirstoosas issife ooththida Phirsiqillassinne Aqilas ta saroka gaththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Hawa 18:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Istti ta gishshas hayqqana gakkanaas bana aaththi immida; tana xalala gidontta Ayzaabetappe ammanidaytikka istta galateettes. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Istta keeththan diza ammaniza asaakka saro giite; Iisiyappe koyro Kirstoosan ammanida ta siiqoza Ephenexoose saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Inttes daro daaburdaaro Maaramo saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Tanara issife qashettida Andiraqonenne Yuniyaase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuniyaase: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuniyaase issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafati Yoliya geettes.</char></note> saro giite; heytantti Hawaareta garsan lo7o sunththara dizaytanne Kirstoosa taappe kase ammanidayta.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Tani Godaa baggara daro siiqiza Philyaxone saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Kirstoosa ooso tanara issife ooththiza Irobanoonenne ta siiqiza Senxakekka saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Kirstoosan iza ammanoy paacettidi galatettida Exesseneesses ta saroka gaththite; Arsixabaloso asaasikka ta saroka gaththite. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ta dabbo Herodiyaana saro giite; Godaan diza Niriqaasoso asaa saro giite.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Godaan gididi minoteththan ooththiza maccassata Tirofimoononne Xirofimoono saro giite; Godaas ooson daro daaburdaaris Kirstoosan tani izo siiqiza Xarsidis ta saroka gaththite. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Godaan doorettida Erufoones, taassinne izas aayo gididaaris ta saroka yootite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar 15:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asqeroones, Afilasoones, Heromeenes, Phaxirobaanes, Hermaanessinne isttara diza ishata ubbatas ta saroka gaththite. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Filegoones, Yuuliyas, Neeriyassinne iza michcheys hessaththoka Alxoones, isttara diza ammanizaytasikka ta saroka gaththite.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Issoy issaa yeeri yeeri ekkidi sarokettite; Kirstoosan ammaniza Woosa Keeththaa asay wurikka inttena saro gees.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ta ishatoo! Asa garsan shaaketeth medhdhizaytappenne intte tamaarda timirtaa ekkontta ixon inttes dhuphe gidiza asatappe intte naagettite. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Heytantta mala asati Yesus Kirstoosas ooththizayta gidontta ba qanththa kaththa gishshas ooththizayta; shugo qaalara haasayaninne wozina kiya asata baleththeettes. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Intte mishiraachcho qaalas azazettizayta gididayssa asi wuri siyides; hessika tana daro ufayssides; gidikkoka intte lo7o hanos cinccata qasse iita oosos eeyata gidana mala ta koyays. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Saroteththa Goday Xala7e eeson intte toho gars aaththi dincereththana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththi inttenara gido.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Tanara issife ooththiza Ximtoosi qasseka ta dabbo Luqiyoosi, Iyaasooneynne Susiphexiroosi inttena saro saro geettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Hawa 16:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Hayssa kiitaa xaafiday tani Xerixiyoosi inttena Godaa sunththan saro gays.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Taninne hayssan diza kumeththa Woosa Keeththa asay mokki ekkiza Gayiyoosikka inttena saro gees; katama miishshaa oykkiza Erisxoosinne nu isha Qo7axiroosi inttena saro geettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Hawa 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Qoro 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2Xim 4:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththi inttenara ubbatara gido. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Tani yootiza Mishiraachcho qaalay Yesus Kirstoosa gishshas yootettiza kiitaynne beni wodeppe doommidi qotan gam7idi ha7i qasse qonccida tuma xuura baggara izi inttena ammanon essanaas dandayees. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Ha7i qasse hayssi tumay qonccides; mernaa Xoossa azazon wurikka ammanidi azazettana mala nabeta maxaafa baggara dereti wurikka iza erana mala hanides.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Izi xalala era gidida Godaas Yesus Kirstoosa baggara mernaa bonchchoy izas gido! Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
